@host = http://localhost:8080

### Start an owner session; reuse its cookie and csrfToken for mutations.
GET {{host}}/api/session

### List the current owner's uploads.
GET {{host}}/api/files

### Readiness includes SQL Server, writable storage, and scanning when enabled.
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Liveness does not require external services.
GET {{host}}/health/live
